VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'platform as I show us. To utilize the cover feature over on Mozart, you\'re going to go to the vibe area, and this is very much like the create area in Suno where you\'re going to put in your lyrics and add your style, and in this case add audio if you want it to be covered. You can add any of the songs'

[01:16] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'you\'ve made on the Mozart platform that are on your library. You can upload existing audio from your hard drive, or you can record audio straight to the page. Let\'s start with creating covers based on just an a cappella recording of singing. And then we\'ll apply a few'

