AUDIO: 'instrumentals and doing covers of them. Why is that so important to me? Well, because back in the day, meaning the early \'90s, I thought I was going to be a music composer and I wrote a lot of music on those early keyboards like the M1 and the Ensoniq SQ R, and I thought'

[09:49] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'everything I did sounded amazing and why isn\'t anyone saying that to me? But now I listen to them and I know why they didn\'t. But when I use this technology, I feel like my life is Mr. Holland\'s Opus. If you don\'t know that film, it\'s'

[10:02] [scene:talk]
